WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.300
Roxy stomped her tiny foot.

2
00:00:07.301 --> 00:00:09.794
"Nobody shrinks Rocket Girl!"

3
00:00:09.795 --> 00:00:12.394
The little girl now looked like a giant.

4
00:00:12.395 --> 00:00:15.829
Roxy watched the girl skip away.

5
00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:19.016
"La, la, la!" the girl sang.

6
00:00:19.017 --> 00:00:22.989
Roxy flew after the girl and fired her eye laser beams.

7
00:00:22.990 --> 00:00:29.981
Whiz-hoo! The tiny laser beams bounced off the girl's neck.

8
00:00:29.982 --> 00:00:32.286
Roxy fired again and again.

9
00:00:32.287 --> 00:00:36.257
Whiz-hoo! Whiz-hoo!

10
00:00:36.258 --> 00:00:41.004
"What was that?" the girl said, feeling her neck.

11
00:00:41.005 --> 00:00:47.045
"It feels like mosquitoes are biting me."

12
00:00:47.046 --> 00:00:50.269
The girl skipped some more.

13
00:00:50.270 --> 00:00:54.730
Then she looked up at Metro City Grand Hotel.

14
00:00:54.731 --> 00:00:58.902
"That's a cute building!" said the girl.

15
00:00:58.903 --> 00:01:01.859
She aimed the device at the building.

16
00:01:01.860 --> 00:01:05.385
"I have to stop this girl," thought Roxy.

17
00:01:05.386 --> 00:01:08.366
"But how? I'm too small."

18
00:01:08.367 --> 00:01:10.392
Roxy thought for a moment.

19
00:01:10.393 --> 00:01:13.218
Then she had an idea.

20
00:01:13.219 --> 00:01:16.941
Zoom! Roxy flew inside the device.

21
00:01:16.942 --> 00:01:20.260
She could see all sorts of wires and gears.

22
00:01:20.261 --> 00:01:24.981
Roxy fired her eye laser beams again. Whiz-hoo!

23
00:01:24.982 --> 00:01:31.721
Ka-boom! Roxy flew back out as the device exploded in the girl's hand.

24
00:01:31.722 --> 00:01:34.963
The girl looked down at the broken device.

25
00:01:34.964 --> 00:01:38.499
She sniffed. Her lip shook.

26
00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:40.931
Tears filled her eyes.

27
00:01:40.932 --> 00:01:45.747
"Waa-aa! Waa-aa!" the girl cried.

28
00:01:45.748 --> 00:01:51.428
"My shrink ray is broken!"

29
00:01:51.429 --> 00:01:54.579
Suddenly a man and woman ran toward her.

30
00:01:54.580 --> 00:01:58.457
They were both wearing space suits. "Abba!"

31
00:01:58.458 --> 00:02:00.711
said the man. "Your

32
00:02:00.712 --> 00:02:04.835
mom and I were looking for you." "The

33
00:02:04.836 --> 00:02:09.228
shrink ray is broken!" Abba cried. "You're

34
00:02:09.229 --> 00:02:13.824
not supposed to play with that!" said the girl's mom. Her

35
00:02:13.825 --> 00:02:16.691
dad looked around and frowned. "You

36
00:02:16.692 --> 00:02:21.472
shrank a bunch of things for your collection, didn't you?" Abba

37
00:02:21.473 --> 00:02:23.056
nodded. "You

38
00:02:23.057 --> 00:02:26.773
shouldn't do that," said her mom. "I'm

39
00:02:26.774 --> 00:02:30.185
sorry," said Abba. "You're

40
00:02:30.186 --> 00:02:33.426
grounded," said her dad. Abba's

41
00:02:33.427 --> 00:02:35.407
mom rubbed her chin. "I'll

42
00:02:35.408 --> 00:02:39.433
get the un-shrink ray." Roxy

43
00:02:39.434 --> 00:02:43.043
flew up to Abba's mom. "Hi!"

44
00:02:43.044 --> 00:02:48.099
said Roxy. "Can you un-shrink people? "

45
00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:51.347
"Of course," said Abba's mom.

46
00:02:51.348 --> 00:02:55.525
"And all the buildings and everything else too."

47
00:02:55.526 --> 00:02:57.556
"Great!" said Roxy.

48
00:02:57.557 --> 00:02:59.615
She thought for a second.

49
00:02:59.616 --> 00:03:04.430
"There's one building that can stay small though."

50
00:03:04.431 --> 00:03:07.319
Metro City was soon back to normal.

51
00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:11.920
Everything and everyone was the right size.

52
00:03:11.921 --> 00:03:18.730
Abba and her parents returned to space.

53
00:03:18.731 --> 00:03:22.540
Roxy and her friends walked home from school.

54
00:03:22.541 --> 00:03:27.979
"Look!" cried Mara. "The old theater is gone!"

55
00:03:27.980 --> 00:03:30.106
"Wow," said Jack.

56
00:03:30.107 --> 00:03:34.286
"Maybe people can plant that community garden now."

57
00:03:34.287 --> 00:03:37.469
Terrell looked at the empty lot suspiciously.

58
00:03:37.470 --> 00:03:41.559
"I wonder if Rocket Girl had something to do with this."

59
00:03:41.560 --> 00:03:45.619
Roxy smiled. "Who knows?

60
00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:47.375
But there's the bakery!

61
00:03:47.376 --> 00:03:55.264
Let's buy some cookies!"

